      "message": "This is a fair question. Note that the implementation follows @tomhughes code review suggestion [here](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/5018794/comment/2d2b4a09_7180f176/). I don\u0027t have a strong opinion on making this common vs not, happy to implement either way. If there is debate here, maybe we move the discussion to the TODO in b/394346384?",
